Both binaries link the Microsoft C/C++ runtime (CRT) statically under the Visual Studio redistribution terms. The
builder also loads Microsoft's OpenMP runtime `vcomp140.dll` (DirectXTex's BC6H/BC7 encoder and the builder's own
parallel texture statistics). It is not in this
package: it comes with the Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable 2015-2022 (x64).
